  "duration_s": 423.207007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国最令人惊叹的峡谷秘境是哪一个吗？有人说是雅鲁藏布大峡谷，五百多公里长，深度排世界第一。有人说是怒江大峡谷三百多公里，两岸的山比谷底高出两千多米。错，这两个都不是第一，真正排在榜首的那条峡谷。错，身边十个人问下来，九个半都没听过他的名字。真正排在榜首的那座秘境，藏在世界屋脊最隐秘的褶皱里。几十座雪峰与大冰川，把整条生谷严丝合缝的所在雪域尽头。今天，咱们就来盘点中国十大令人惊叹的峡谷秘境。第十名，金丝大峡谷，陕西商洛商南见他藏在秦岭南路，而秦岭东西横着一千六百多公里，是中国南北方的分界线。山里的溪水顺着岩缝，一年一年往下切，硬是切出一条峡谷。您要是从城里忙的脚不沾地，跑到这儿往鼓里一走，溪水绕着脚边流，两边是密密的林子，头顶是尖尖的奇风，耳朵里只剩水声，浑身的骨头都松下来了。别的峡谷靠险下人，他靠的是山水林岩一层叠一层，把您的脚步越走越慢。榜单从他开始，因为惊叹不一定是倒吸一口凉气，有时候是舍不得走，您说这算不算一种惊叹？第九名，巫山小三峡，重庆巫山，他是大宁河下游的三段峡谷，龙门峡八雾峡低翠峡一段接一段加起来几十公里。您往船上一坐，水清的能数出河底的石头，两边的绝壁仿佛要贴到船舷上。水面静的像一面镜子，言闭半山腰，还留着一排排方方正正的时空，那是古人当年凿出来的栈道孔牙缝里还摆着玄关一放就是两千来年，他不是最高的，也不是最险的。可中国人心里山水画该有的样子，山水州人他一样不少。您说这算不算最地道的东方意境？第八名，马岭河大峡谷，贵州兴义。您想想，一条峡谷里到处都是瀑布，会是什么样？他就是这个样，峡谷长七十多公里，谷深一百多到两百来米。几十道瀑布从崖顶一路挂下来，您站在谷底，水汽扑的满脸都是凉丝丝的扑生在两面，崖壁之间来回撞，像有人在头顶不停的洗牌。这些瀑布不光会流还会长，山里的水带着碳酸钙，一年一年渗出在崖壁，长成一层又一层石帘子把整面崖壁都裹了起来。别的地方瀑布是一道井，在这儿，瀑布是整条峡谷的墙，您说这算不算一条挂在地缝里的瀑布？长廊，第七名，大渡河金口大峡谷，四川乐山金口河。如果说前面的峡谷讲究秀丽，这一条给给您的就是纯粹的视觉震撼。全长二十六公里，骨宽不过两三百米，但两岸山崖的最大垂直落差竟然达到了两千六百米。大渡河水像一把锋利的钢刀，花了上千万年，硬生生劈开坚硬的玄武岩层，连阳光一天都照不进几个小时。您站在峡谷底下的窄轨铁道边，抬头看，两侧黑黝黝的巨壁，像要合拢砸下来一样，人在里头小的就像一粒沙子，这种能把人看傻的庞大尺度。您说震撼不震撼？第六名天山、神秘大峡谷，新疆库车，您是不是觉得峡谷就该是青山绿水？新疆这一条会直接改掉您的想象，当地人叫他克兹利亚，维吾尔语林就是红色的山崖，整条峡谷全是红砂岩高的地方上百米。窄的地方只够一个人侧着身子挤过去，这些岩层是上亿年前一层层沉下来的。后来山洪和缝像刻刀一样，一年年飙成了这副模样。您走进去，脚下是干沙，两边是烧红了似的岩壁，您喊一嗓子回声，顺着岩缝滚出去。老远。岩壁上一道道纹怒，像火苗被冻住了。别的峡谷是绿的，它是红的，别的峡谷靠水，它靠石头。您说这算不算长在地球上的火星？从第十到第六名金丝大峡谷，让人舍不得走。巫山小三峡是一副能划着船走进去的山水画，马岭河把几十道瀑布挂进了地缝。大渡河金口大峡谷把天挤成了一条缝，天山神秘大峡谷把大地染成了火星，可他们还不是最令人惊叹的。接下来第五道第一名更绝，有一条深谷，把绝壁、地缝、天坑全都揉在一块儿一根上。百米高的石柱立在风雨里，千万年不倒，有一座雪山，巨口吞下了整整一条翻滚的金沙江咆哮声。能传出几里地，可排在榜首的那座被几十条万年冰川与重重雪风严丝合缝的扣在雪域深处。他凭什么排在大名鼎鼎的雅鲁藏布大峡谷前面下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国最令人惊叹的峡谷秘境。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 470,
      "end_ms": 5610,
      "text": "您知道中国最令人惊叹的峡谷秘境是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5990,
      "end_ms": 8770,
      "text": "有人说是雅鲁藏布大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 9310,
      "end_ms": 10510,
      "text": "五百多公里长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11130,
      "end_ms": 12970,
      "text": "深度排世界第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13450,
      "end_ms": 17270,
      "text": "有人说是怒江大峡谷三百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17750,
      "end_ms": 20870,
      "text": "两岸的山比谷底高出两千多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 21110,
      "end_ms": 21350,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22090,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "这两个都不是第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24370,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那条峡谷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27990,
      "end_ms": 28230,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28270,
      "end_ms": 29935,
      "text": "身边十个人问下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30620,
      "end_ms": 32680,
      "text": "九个半都没听过他的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33060,
      "end_ms": 35680,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那座秘境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36380,
      "end_ms": 39740,
      "text": "藏在世界屋脊最隐秘的褶皱里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40360,
      "end_ms": 42680,
      "text": "几十座雪峰与大冰川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43340,
      "end_ms": 48140,
      "text": "把整条生谷严丝合缝的所在雪域尽头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48580,
      "end_ms": 49040,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49060,
      "end_ms": 53880,
      "text": "咱们就来盘点中国十大令人惊叹的峡谷秘境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54380,
      "end_ms": 55260,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55980,
      "end_ms": 57180,
      "text": "金丝大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 57940,
      "end_ms": 62555,
      "text": "陕西商洛商南见他藏在秦岭南路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 63130,
      "end_ms": 67045,
      "text": "而秦岭东西横着一千六百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67500,
      "end_ms": 69995,
      "text": "是中国南北方的分界线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70640,
      "end_ms": 72755,
      "text": "山里的溪水顺着岩缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 73440,
      "end_ms": 74925,
      "text": "一年一年往下切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 75870,
      "end_ms": 77815,
      "text": "硬是切出一条峡谷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 78350,
      "end_ms": 80850,
      "text": "您要是从城里忙的脚不沾地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 80870,
      "end_ms": 82975,
      "text": "跑到这儿往鼓里一走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 83430,
      "end_ms": 85235,
      "text": "溪水绕着脚边流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 85650,
      "end_ms": 87485,
      "text": "两边是密密的林子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 87940,
      "end_ms": 89760,
      "text": "头顶是尖尖的奇风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90100,
      "end_ms": 91875,
      "text": "耳朵里只剩水声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 92250,
      "end_ms": 94445,
      "text": "浑身的骨头都松下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 95040,
      "end_ms": 97245,
      "text": "别的峡谷靠险下人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 97680,
      "end_ms": 102955,
      "text": "他靠的是山水林岩一层叠一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 103260,
      "end_ms": 105185,
      "text": "把您的脚步越走越慢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 105820,
      "end_ms": 107425,
      "text": "榜单从他开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 107780,
      "end_ms": 110785,
      "text": "因为惊叹不一定是倒吸一口凉气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 111230,
      "end_ms": 112875,
      "text": "有时候是舍不得走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 113430,
      "end_ms": 116255,
      "text": "您说这算不算一种惊叹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 116720,
      "end_ms": 117535,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117950,
      "end_ms": 119130,
      "text": "巫山小三峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119710,
      "end_ms": 120585,
      "text": "重庆巫山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 121350,
      "end_ms": 123765,
      "text": "他是大宁河下游的三段峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 124290,
      "end_ms": 130015,
      "text": "龙门峡八雾峡低翠峡一段接一段加起来几十公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 130500,
      "end_ms": 132165,
      "text": "您往船上一坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 132870,
      "end_ms": 135865,
      "text": "水清的能数出河底的石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 136470,
      "end_ms": 140365,
      "text": "两边的绝壁仿佛要贴到船舷上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 140870,
      "end_ms": 143455,
      "text": "水面静的像一面镜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 143860,
      "end_ms": 145575,
      "text": "言闭半山腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 145990,
      "end_ms": 148865,
      "text": "还留着一排排方方正正的时空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 149530,
      "end_ms": 157245,
      "text": "那是古人当年凿出来的栈道孔牙缝里还摆着玄关一放就是两千来年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 157640,
      "end_ms": 158635,
      "text": "他不是最高的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 159020,
      "end_ms": 160205,
      "text": "也不是最险的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 160590,
      "end_ms": 163505,
      "text": "可中国人心里山水画该有的样子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 163870,
      "end_ms": 166045,
      "text": "山水州人他一样不少。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 166490,
      "end_ms": 169005,
      "text": "您说这算不算最地道的东方意境？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 169360,
      "end_ms": 170145,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 170540,
      "end_ms": 171805,
      "text": "马岭河大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172120,
      "end_ms": 173095,
      "text": "贵州兴义。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 173430,
      "end_ms": 174055,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 174340,
      "end_ms": 176445,
      "text": "一条峡谷里到处都是瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 176740,
      "end_ms": 177460,
      "text": "会是什么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 177620,
      "end_ms": 178555,
      "text": "他就是这个样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 179120,
      "end_ms": 181540,
      "text": "峡谷长七十多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 182000,
      "end_ms": 184540,
      "text": "谷深一百多到两百来米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 185080,
      "end_ms": 188780,
      "text": "几十道瀑布从崖顶一路挂下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 189240,
      "end_ms": 190340,
      "text": "您站在谷底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 190880,
      "end_ms": 195780,
      "text": "水汽扑的满脸都是凉丝丝的扑生在两面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 195840,
      "end_ms": 197460,
      "text": "崖壁之间来回撞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 198120,
      "end_ms": 200700,
      "text": "像有人在头顶不停的洗牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 201340,
      "end_ms": 204160,
      "text": "这些瀑布不光会流还会长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 204960,
      "end_ms": 207580,
      "text": "山里的水带着碳酸钙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 208260,
      "end_ms": 210550,
      "text": "一年一年渗出在崖壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211170,
      "end_ms": 217130,
      "text": "长成一层又一层石帘子把整面崖壁都裹了起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 217530,
      "end_ms": 219890,
      "text": "别的地方瀑布是一道井，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 220430,
      "end_ms": 221090,
      "text": "在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 221450,
      "end_ms": 223970,
      "text": "瀑布是整条峡谷的墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 224550,
      "end_ms": 228530,
      "text": "您说这算不算一条挂在地缝里的瀑布？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 228530,
      "end_ms": 228990,
      "text": "长廊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 229310,
      "end_ms": 230010,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 230410,
      "end_ms": 232830,
      "text": "大渡河金口大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 233090,
      "end_ms": 234990,
      "text": "四川乐山金口河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 235850,
      "end_ms": 238650,
      "text": "如果说前面的峡谷讲究秀丽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 239190,
      "end_ms": 242875,
      "text": "这一条给给您的就是纯粹的视觉震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 243340,
      "end_ms": 244765,
      "text": "全长二十六公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 245360,
      "end_ms": 247815,
      "text": "骨宽不过两三百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 248440,
      "end_ms": 254285,
      "text": "但两岸山崖的最大垂直落差竟然达到了两千六百米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 254770,
      "end_ms": 257395,
      "text": "大渡河水像一把锋利的钢刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 257760,
      "end_ms": 259275,
      "text": "花了上千万年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 259600,
      "end_ms": 262755,
      "text": "硬生生劈开坚硬的玄武岩层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 263190,
      "end_ms": 266105,
      "text": "连阳光一天都照不进几个小时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266540,
      "end_ms": 269240,
      "text": "您站在峡谷底下的窄轨铁道边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 269280,
      "end_ms": 269985,
      "text": "抬头看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 270510,
      "end_ms": 272230,
      "text": "两侧黑黝黝的巨壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 272230,
      "end_ms": 273995,
      "text": "像要合拢砸下来一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 274540,
      "end_ms": 276925,
      "text": "人在里头小的就像一粒沙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 277310,
      "end_ms": 280465,
      "text": "这种能把人看傻的庞大尺度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 280850,
      "end_ms": 282095,
      "text": "您说震撼不震撼？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 282500,
      "end_ms": 285375,
      "text": "第六名天山、神秘大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 285740,
      "end_ms": 286985,
      "text": "新疆库车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 287390,
      "end_ms": 291115,
      "text": "您是不是觉得峡谷就该是青山绿水？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291600,
      "end_ms": 295025,
      "text": "新疆这一条会直接改掉您的想象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 295590,
      "end_ms": 297975,
      "text": "当地人叫他克兹利亚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 298480,
      "end_ms": 301595,
      "text": "维吾尔语林就是红色的山崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 302140,
      "end_ms": 307065,
      "text": "整条峡谷全是红砂岩高的地方上百米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 307570,
      "end_ms": 311290,
      "text": "窄的地方只够一个人侧着身子挤过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 312050,
      "end_ms": 317630,
      "text": "这些岩层是上亿年前一层层沉下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 318050,
      "end_ms": 321530,
      "text": "后来山洪和缝像刻刀一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 321810,
      "end_ms": 323910,
      "text": "一年年飙成了这副模样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 324490,
      "end_ms": 325470,
      "text": "您走进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 325670,
      "end_ms": 326970,
      "text": "脚下是干沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 327630,
      "end_ms": 329950,
      "text": "两边是烧红了似的岩壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 330670,
      "end_ms": 333070,
      "text": "您喊一嗓子回声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 333130,
      "end_ms": 334770,
      "text": "顺着岩缝滚出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 334770,
      "end_ms": 335170,
      "text": "老远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 335770,
      "end_ms": 337720,
      "text": "岩壁上一道道纹怒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 337960,
      "end_ms": 339620,
      "text": "像火苗被冻住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 339920,
      "end_ms": 341360,
      "text": "别的峡谷是绿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 341480,
      "end_ms": 342260,
      "text": "它是红的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 342860,
      "end_ms": 344240,
      "text": "别的峡谷靠水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 344660,
      "end_ms": 345560,
      "text": "它靠石头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 345920,
      "end_ms": 349860,
      "text": "您说这算不算长在地球上的火星？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 350620,
      "end_ms": 354420,
      "text": "从第十到第六名金丝大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 354420,
      "end_ms": 355600,
      "text": "让人舍不得走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 356240,
      "end_ms": 360160,
      "text": "巫山小三峡是一副能划着船走进去的山水画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 360620,
      "end_ms": 363500,
      "text": "马岭河把几十道瀑布挂进了地缝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 363940,
      "end_ms": 367245,
      "text": "大渡河金口大峡谷把天挤成了一条缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 367750,
      "end_ms": 371425,
      "text": "天山神秘大峡谷把大地染成了火星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 372180,
      "end_ms": 374935,
      "text": "可他们还不是最令人惊叹的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 375600,
      "end_ms": 377905,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 378530,
      "end_ms": 379755,
      "text": "有一条深谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 380090,
      "end_ms": 385310,
      "text": "把绝壁、地缝、天坑全都揉在一块儿一根上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 385330,
      "end_ms": 387690,
      "text": "百米高的石柱立在风雨里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00135",
      "start_ms": 387810,
      "end_ms": 388865,
      "text": "千万年不倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00136",
      "start_ms": 389220,
      "end_ms": 390220,
      "text": "有一座雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00137",
      "start_ms": 390420,
      "end_ms": 395030,
      "text": "巨口吞下了整整一条翻滚的金沙江咆哮声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00138",
      "start_ms": 395050,
      "end_ms": 396455,
      "text": "能传出几里地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00139",
      "start_ms": 396840,
      "end_ms": 406235,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座被几十条万年冰川与重重雪风严丝合缝的扣在雪域深处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00140",
      "start_ms": 406960,
      "end_ms": 413935,
      "text": "他凭什么排在大名鼎鼎的雅鲁藏布大峡谷前面下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00141",
      "start_ms": 414340,
      "end_ms": 415420,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00142",
      "start_ms": 415520,
      "end_ms": 418445,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2b712193f42f6d1_s00143",
      "start_ms": 418880,
      "end_ms": 422785,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国最令人惊叹的峡谷秘境。"
    }
  ],
